Plastics Products; Paper and Board Products; and Property and Group Services. The company offers cores and tubes, including carton dividers, conical containers, heavy and light duty cores, paper straws, paper bags, tape and yarn cores, void fillers, paper cores/tubes, convolute cores, postal tubes, textile paper cones, composite tubes, textile yarn carriers, box dividing partitions/inserts, honeycomb/dufaylite for doors, precision slitting, and edge protectors/angle boards/corner pieces. It also provides beige, bulk, clear utility, garbie, garbie super saver, green garden, heavy duty orange, and house branded refuse bags, as well as swing and trolley bin liners; and flexibles plastic packaging and scholastic supplies, which includes banana punched boutique and fresh produce bags, jiffy paper and plastic stationary, loop handle and plastic boutique bags, poly book covering rolls, school sheets, and vest type carrier bags. In addition, the company offers general packaging, machinery, safety, cleaning, and chemical products; bag papers and plastics; catering, cleaning, and safety wear; inside carton and box protection; and packaging equipment, pallet stability, paper/corrugated/board products, plastic packaging, and scholastic stationary products; and stationary, tape, twine, and closures. Further, it provides pallet stabilization film, pallet wrap, and pallet wrap operating equipment, as well as braille printed carton, carton board and window folded boxes, dispensers, paper instruction inserts, and point of sale stands. It serves retail, general packaging, transport, industrial, agriculture, cosmetics, food, mining, pharmaceutical, and veterinary markets. Transpaco Limited was incorporated in 1951 and is headquartered in Johannesburg, South Africa.","employees":1450,"website":"https://www.transpaco.co.za","country":"South Africa","city":"Johannesburg","officers":[{"name":"Mr. Phillip Norman Abelheim FCIS","title":"CEO & Executive Director"},{"name":"Mr. Louis  Weinber